    "timestampMs": 3760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "it isn't because you're lazy.",
    "startMs": 5200,
    "endMs": 7000,
    "timestampMs": 5200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It's because the first step you pictured was too big.",
    "startMs": 7000,
    "endMs": 9760,
    "timestampMs": 7000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Your brain quietly refuses anything that looks expensive,",
    "startMs": 9760,
    "endMs": 13080,
    "timestampMs": 9760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "so shrink it.",
    "startMs": 13080,
    "endMs": 14240,
    "timestampMs": 13080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Not go to the gym, put on your shoes.",
    "startMs": 14240,
    "endMs": 16520,
    "timestampMs": 14240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Not write the report, open the file.",
