    "endMs": 18680,
    "timestampMs": 16520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Not read more, one page.",
    "startMs": 18680,
    "endMs": 20640,
    "timestampMs": 18680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The trick isn't discipline.",
    "startMs": 20640,
    "endMs": 22440,
    "timestampMs": 20640,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It's lowering the entry cost",
    "startMs": 22440,
    "endMs": 23920,
    "timestampMs": 22440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "until saying no feel sillier than saying yes.",
    "startMs": 23920,
    "endMs": 26400,
    "timestampMs": 23920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Once you begin, momentum does the rest.",
    "startMs": 26400,
    "endMs": 29080,
    "timestampMs": 26400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Starting is the only part that's actually hard.",
    "startMs": 29080,
    "endMs": 32120,
    "timestampMs": 29080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The middle takes care of itself,",
    "startMs": 32120,
    "endMs": 33920,
    "timestampMs": 32120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "so next time you feel stuck,",
    "startMs": 33920,
    "endMs": 35560,
    "timestampMs": 33920,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "don't ask how to get motivated.",
