    "endMs": 37720,
    "timestampMs": 35560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Ask what the smallest possible first move is,",
    "startMs": 37720,
    "endMs": 40400,
    "timestampMs": 37720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and then make it embarrassingly small.",
    "startMs": 40400,
    "endMs": 43040,
    "timestampMs": 40400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That's it.",
    "startMs": 43040,
    "endMs": 44040,
    "timestampMs": 43040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
